WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with legs wide in a comfortable V, toes and kneecaps pointing up.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Root the sitting bones and lengthen the spine tall on an inhale.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Walk the hands forward between the legs, hinging from the hips.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the spine long — stop when the back wants to round.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Stay and breathe into the inner thighs; walk the hands back to rise.
